3. **Architecture Enhancements:**
   - **Implementation:** Flask is suitable for this project, but it may benefit from implementing Flask Blueprints to handle different routes more effectively, minimizing clutter in the main application file.
   
   - **UI Design:** The UI could benefit from improving navigation by adding breadcrumbs, so users can easily track their location and navigate back to previous pages.
   
   - **Data Storage:** While using text files is acceptable for this project scale, consider implementing CSV files for structured data storage which can be more easily parsed and manipulated than plain text format. Additionally, ensure there are mechanisms for backup and data recovery in case of file corruption.

